# 🧪 Godot 4 Automated Testing & TDD with GUT

This skill provides the standards and templates for writing **automated unit, integration, and scene tests** using the **GUT (Godot Unit Test)** framework in Godot 4.x.

---

## 🏗️ 1. Test Architecture & Directory Layout

```text
res://
├── test/
│   ├── unit/                      # Isolated logic tests (Resources, Components, Math)
│   │   ├── test_health_component.gd
│   │   ├── test_inventory_component.gd
│   │   └── test_goap_planner.gd
│   ├── integration/               # Multi-component interaction tests
│   │   ├── test_combat_flow.gd
│   │   └── test_quest_progression.gd
│   └── fixtures/                  # Mock resources and test scene prefabs
```

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Runner["Headless CLI Runner:\ngodot --headless -s addons/gut/gut_cmdln.gd -gdir=res://test/unit -gexit"]
    Runner --> Discovery["Discover all test_*.gd scripts"]
    Discovery --> Life["Lifecycle: before_all -> before_each -> test_* -> after_each -> after_all"]
    Life --> Assert["Evaluate Assertions:\nassert_eq, assert_true, assert_signal_emitted"]
    Assert --> Report["Generate JUnit XML / Console Test Summary"]
```

