## 💻 4. Headless CLI Execution Command

Run test suites automatically in headless terminals or CI pipelines:

```powershell
# Run all unit tests headless in Windows PowerShell
& "godot" --headless -s addons/gut/gut_cmdln.gd -gdir="res://test/unit" -gexit
```
